A '''port''' on the [[planet]] [[Mapuzo]] was operating<ref name="III" /> by [[9 BBY]]. That [[Standard year|year]],<ref name="Date">{{KenobiDate|III}}</ref> the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[captain]] [[Tala Durith]] arranged for a [[Unidentified human pilot (Mapuzo)|pilot]] to transport the [[Alderaanian]] [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] and the [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] off of Mapuzo from the port. However, the [[pilot]] was murdered by the [[Inquisitor]] [[Reva Sevander|Third Sister]] while in the port. Not long after, Organa ran from a [[Mapuzo safehouse|Hidden Path safehouse]] to the port, intending to meet with Durith's pilot, but was instead captured by the Third Sister.<ref name="III" />

